cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The Disruptor: A Corporate Entrepreneurship & Innovation Simulation"
message: "If you use this simulation in research or teaching, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Salter
    given-names: Ammon
    affiliation: "Warwick Business School, University of Warwick"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2065-1268"
abstract: >-
  A free browser simulation for teaching corporate entrepreneurship and
  innovation management. The player becomes Chief Innovation Officer of
  Vélox Dynamics, a fictional fitness equipment manufacturer in Vilvoorde,
  Belgium, on a three-year brief or a one-year probation, and runs sixteen
  connected systems under a management board that sets a goal and three
  objectives each year. It runs from its own folder in a browser, with no
  install, no server and no account.
repository-code: "https://github.com/ammonsalter-del/thedisruptor-sim"
